{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/282db283741fdd1864f6515629598aee.poster.avif?t=1758886240\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/282db283741fdd1864f6515629598aee.webm?t=1758886240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/282db283741fdd1864f6515629598aee.mp4?t=1758886240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Rise Again is an action RPG that combines elements of wizardry, roguelike gameplay, and dungeon crawling. Hack and slash your way through enemies in a medieval fantasy universe, transforming from a forgetful wizard into a skilled dungeon crawler as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spellbinding Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you delivered the final blow, you fell victim to the Lich's curse. You can't remember anything before the curse. As you open your eyes, you find yourself in a mysterious realm with a Portal that resurrects the dead. Explore the new realm, uncover the truth behind resurrection,  and overcome the challenges of this realm alongside others cursed like you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/e0cbcfad1ecf9b205218e90a767db185.poster.avif?t=1758886240\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/e0cbcfad1ecf9b205218e90a767db185.webm?t=1758886240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/e0cbcfad1ecf9b205218e90a767db185.mp4?t=1758886240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Art of Combat...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the ever-changing dungeons to break free from the Lich's Curse, defeat the summoned creatures. Discover numerous spells and enhancements throughout your adventure. Experience unique battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/81a6bae9c9acca6d193e3b4e0a1c097f.poster.avif?t=1758886240\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/extras/81a6bae9c9acca6d193e3b4e0a1c097f.webm?t=1758886240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are you ready to Rise Again?</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2345170?t=1758886240","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2345170?t=1758886240","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/fdd227f8fe5b380502e83d6d55d16674bec09cc0/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1758886240","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345170/fdd227f8fe5b380502e83d6d55d16674bec09cc0/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1758886240","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Rise Again contains General Mature Content and therefore may not be suitable for all ages.\r\nIt includes realistic depic